{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42135","headline":"送和州张员外爲江都令 · 徐铉","name":"送和州张员外爲江都令","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"经年相望隔重湖，一旦相逢在上都。\n塞诏官班聊慰否，埋轮意气尚存无。\n由来圣代怜才子，始觉清风激懦夫。\n若向西冈寻胜赏，旧题名处爲踌躇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42135.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42135","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}